      "writtenOn": "2024-12-05T19:46:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So, multiple tasks can be waiting on a held lock. We want to make sure on release the lock owner passes the lock to the donor task that was boosting it at that moment. This avoids handing the lock off to a \"less important\" task.",
      "parentUuid": "e50a7c2a_de5c8f07",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 10,
